Description: local-first CTF flag discovery desktop application
 CTF Hunter passively finds CTF flags in selected terminal output and watched
 files, and analyzes manually submitted data. It preserves provenance across
 bounded recursive decoding and stores findings in a per-user SQLite database.
 .
 The package contains a native desktop interface, an unprivileged per-user
 analysis daemon, a diagnostic command-line client, and a narrowly privileged
 eBPF terminal capture helper.
